# Database-Driven AI SQL Agent Enforcement Plan

This plan outlines the changes to completely remove hardcoded database concepts, implement automatic schema/lookup/enum learning, enforce read-only safety, and construct a purely deterministic RAG SQL generator that never hallucinates database information.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The agent will lose its hardcoded "fallback" queries (e.g. `PREDEFINED_COMMON_QUERIES` in `sql_agent.py`) and hardcoded intent shortcuts. Everything will strictly be resolved via the database schema and lookup tables.

