#### [MODIFY] [knowledge_graph.py](file:///c:/Users/nayak_o7hopi6/Desktop/Agent/app/knowledge/knowledge_graph.py)
- Remove hardcoded `RELATIONSHIP_EDGES`. Read relationships strictly from `relationships.json` and `schema_metadata.json`.

